  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1703.01 Hearings on Fees and Charges",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1703.01 Hearings on Fees and Charges. Any person who wishes to dispute fees or charges against him or her by the state under this subdivision shall be entitled to a hearing before the commissioner or his or her designee in accordance with the hearing process established by RSA 260:44, II, which shall be liberally construed so as to also apply to this subdivision.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 1700) #13379, EXEMPT, eff 5-23-22\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c1700.html"
